models.description:
Core product catalog entries with name, description, category, and base price linked to seller.

This table stores the current active state of each product. Every time a seller modifies the product's name, description, category, or base price, a new immutable snapshot is created in shopping_mall_product_snapshots to preserve the historical state. The product in this table represents the latest version available for purchase. Products can be logically deleted via deleted_at for compliance and audit purposes, but all past snapshots remain intact.

This table is referenced by shopping_mall_product_images, shopping_mall_product_variants, and shopping_mall_product_snapshot_variants. It does not store variant details, images, or pricing overrides—all of which are stored in their respective tables and captured in snapshots.

@link shopping_mall_sellers.id
@link shopping_mall_categories.id
@link shopping_mall_product_snapshots.product_id
